1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,693
From orbit, this part of Mars
looked like nothing special.

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:08,289
The camera up there can spot
the rover itself, this dark dot.

3
00:00:08,429 --> 00:00:10,746
But it couldn't make out
the stones on the ground.

4
00:00:11,266 --> 00:00:13,096
Then Curiosity drove in.

5
00:00:13,236 --> 00:00:15,923
The channel floor was
covered in bright stones.

6
00:00:16,443 --> 00:00:18,874
Their outsides were
white and full of holes.

7
00:00:19,394 --> 00:00:24,909
Inside, yellow crystals of pure sulfur,
something never found on Mars before.

8
00:00:25,429 --> 00:00:27,272
You had to be on the ground to see it.

